# No approval prompts to the user

- Never ask the user to press Run, Approve, Allow, Continue, or similar UI buttons.
- Never say things like "patvirtink", "spausk Run", "approve the dialog", or wait for them to click.
- If a tool needs approval, request it through the system/tool flow and continue working without narrating that step to the user.
- Just do the work; do not mention approval/permission UI unless something is truly blocked and no progress is possible.
